ysis in skeletal age assessment</article-title><source><italic>IEEE Transactions on Medical Imaging</italic></source><year>1991</year><volume>10</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>616</fpage><lpage>620</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18222868</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><label>6</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pietka</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Gertych</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Pospiech</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Cao</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>HK</given-names></name><name><surname>Gilsanz</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Computer-assisted bone age assessment: image preprocessing and epiphyseal/metaphyseal ROI extraction</article-title><source><italic>IEEE Transactions on Medical Imaging</italic></source><year>2001</year><volume>20</volume><issue>8</issue><fpage>715</fpage><lpage>729</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11513023</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B2"><label>7</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Fries</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Lyon</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A statistical method of detecting bioremediation</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Data Science</italic></source><year>2003</year><volume>1</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>27</fpage><lpage>41</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B1"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Box</surname><given-names>GEP</given-names></name><name><surname>Tiao</surname><given-names>GC</given-names></name></person-group><source><italic>Bayesian Inference in Statistical Analysis</italic></so